* =====================================================================================================
* oled_boost__ssd1351.lib  --  SSD1351 / NHD-1.5-128128G panel, VCC (FPC pin 2) load seen by the boost
* -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Parts     : Newhaven NHD-1.5-128128G (SSD1351U3 COF), on J20 pin 2 (VCC) and pin 27 (VCI = +3V3)
* Datasheets: https://newhavendisplay.com/content/specs/NHD-1.5-128128G.pdf (rev 3, 04/16/2024,
*             "Electrical Characteristics": VCC 12.5 / 13 / 13.5 V; ICC at VCC 13 V: 50 % ON 23.2 typ /
*             29.0 max mA, 100 % ON 33.4 typ / 42.0 max mA)
*             https://cdn-shop.adafruit.com/datasheets/SSD1351-Revision+1.3.pdf (Solomon SSD1351 Rev 1.3,
*             Oct 2009: Table 11-1 VCC abs max 19.0 V; 8.9 power ON/OFF sequence and notes (1), (2), (5))
* Vendor    : none (a panel is not offered as a SPICE model).
*
* Modelled:
*   Content current  The segment drivers are current sources (SSD1351 8.x, IREF-set), so the VCC load is a
*                    current sink.  Its value is the control voltage on ICTL in volts = mA (e.g. a PWL
*                    0 -> 42 gives 0 -> 42 mA), constant above VFULL = 10 V (SSD1351 feature list:
*                    "VCC = 10.0 V - 18.0 V") and falling linearly to 0 at VCC = 0 (driver headroom loss;
*                    shape below 10 V is an assumption, only reached when the boost cannot regulate).
*   Display off      ICTL = 0 (after AEh, and for >= 200 ms after VCC comes up until AFh is sent).
*   ESD path         SSD1351 8.9 note (1): an ESD structure from VCI/VDDIO to VCC holds VCC near VCI - Vf
*                    when VCC is off; modelled as a small silicon diode VCI -> VCC (IS 1e-14).
*
* NOT modelled: VCC ripple sensitivity / PSRR of the segment drivers, the panel's own VCC-pin capacitance
*   (not specified; the 10 uF + 100 nF at the ZIF are in the netlist), VCOMH / VSL networks (separate
*   pins, own caps), switching transients of row scanning (ICC is treated as its average), ICC spread
*   between parts other than the typ / max table values that the test selects.
*
* Pins: VCC VCI GND ICTL
* =====================================================================================================
.subckt SSD1351_VCC_OB VCC VCI GND ICTL params: VFULL=10
Bload VCC GND I = max(V(ICTL,GND), 0) * 1m * min(max(V(VCC,GND), 0)/{VFULL}, 1)
Desd VCI VCC DESD_OB1351
.model DESD_OB1351 D(IS=1e-14 N=1 RS=10)
Rctl ICTL GND 1G
.ends SSD1351_VCC_OB
